    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can alter your appearance to resemble a specific person.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Shapeshift Species Trait, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Focus\" title=\"Skill Focus\">Skill Focus (Deception)</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check to alter your features to that of a specific person. This Feat also allows you to change your voice to match the target's. You always treat impersonating a person as a Moderate Deception.</p>",
